1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,670
5 words to never say in sales.

2
00:00:03,850 --> 00:00:12,080
[PAIRS - rapid fire]
Don't say customer, instead say client - because people clients

3
00:00:12,260 --> 00:00:16,460
feel like partners, customers feel like numbers.

4
00:00:16,640 --> 00:00:23,290
Don't say contract, instead say agreement - agreements are mutual, contracts feel

5
00:00:23,470 --> 00:00:25,370
one-sided.

6
00:00:25,550 --> 00:00:32,270
Don't say buy, instead say invest - people invest in value, not purchases.

7
00:00:32,450 --> 00:00:39,100
Don't say maybe, instead say absolutely - certainty closes, maybe kills.

8
00:00:39,280 --> 00:00:46,430
Don't say sign, instead say authorize - authorizing feels like a choice, not a trap.

9
00:00:46,610 --> 00:00:50,760
Your sales does not have to sound like everyone else's.

10
00:00:50,940 --> 00:00:54,880
Comment 'TOOL' and I will send you the full list.

11
00:00:55,060 --> 00:00:59,260
Make sure you follow - it only goes to followers.
